|-------|---------|
| `DomainException` | Thrown when a command violates a business invariant (negative balance, closed account) |
| `AggregateNotFoundException` | Thrown when an aggregate is not found in the event store |
| `HandlerNotFoundException` | Thrown when no handler is registered for a command or query |

#### Domain Events (Immutable Records)
| Event | Fields | Purpose |
|-------|--------|---------|
| `AccountOpened` | `aggregateId`, `owner`, `initialBalance` | Emitted when a new account is created |
| `MoneyDeposited` | `aggregateId`, `amount` | Emitted when money is deposited |
| `MoneyWithdrawn` | `aggregateId`, `amount` | Emitted when money is withdrawn |
| `AccountClosed` | `aggregateId` | Emitted when an account is closed |

#### Commands (Immutable Records)
| Command | Fields | Returns | Purpose |
|---------|--------|---------|---------|
| `OpenAccount` | `owner`, `initialBalance` | `String` (account id) | Opens a new account |
| `DepositMoney` | `accountId`, `amount` | `Void` | Deposits money |
| `WithdrawMoney` | `accountId`, `amount` | `Void` | Withdraws money |
| `CloseAccount` | `accountId` | `Void` | Closes an account |

#### Queries (Immutable Records)
| Query | Fields | Returns | Purpose |
|-------|--------|---------|---------|
| `FindAccountById` | `accountId` | `Optional<AccountView>` | Finds a single account |
| `ListAllAccounts` | — | `List<AccountView>` | Lists all open accounts |
| `CountAccounts` | — | `Integer` | Counts open accounts |
| `FindAccountsByOwner` | `owner` | `List<AccountView>` | Finds accounts by owner |

#### Command Side (Write Model)
| Component | Storage | Thread-Safety |
|-----------|---------|---------------|
| `AccountAggregate` | In-memory (transient) | Not shared — created per request |
| `EventStore` | `ConcurrentHashMap<String, List<DomainEvent>>` | `computeIfAbsent`, `getOrDefault` are atomic |
| `AccountRepository` | Delegates to `EventStore` | Thread-safe via `EventStore` |
| `CommandBus` | `ConcurrentHashMap<Class<?>, CommandHandler>` | `put`, `get` are atomic |

#### Query Side (Read Model)
| Component | Storage | Thread-Safety |
|-----------|---------|---------------|
| `AccountReadModel` | `ConcurrentHashMap<String, AccountView>` | `put`, `get`, stream operations are atomic |
| `AccountProjection` | Delegates to `AccountReadModel` | Thread-safe via `AccountReadModel` |
| `QueryBus` | `ConcurrentHashMap<Class<?>, QueryHandler>` | `put`, `get` are atomic |

